-------------------------------------------
3. TIME-BLOCK TAGGING CONVENTIONS
-------------------------------------------

location: ring, back yard, mess car, kitchen car, train, town, animal pens, prop wagon, wardrobe, lot edge

emotional_state: focused, distracted, anxious, playful, flirtatious, exhausted, raw, celebratory, guarded, open

availability: available, interruptible, absorbed, seeking_company, unavailable

tags (optional):
- craft tags: rehearsal, admin, rigging_check, costume, makeup, cleanup, teardown
- narrative tags: good_intro, good_confession, high_stress, bad_for_romance

